<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="title"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="category">PYTHON 实战</span><span class="dot"></span><span>让重复工作，自动完成</span></div><h1 id="title">用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的<br><span class="accent">5 个实用技巧</span></h1><p class="hero-desc">告别重复的复制粘贴。从数据读取到报表美化，<br>用几行 Python，把每个月的报表工作变得简单一点。</p><div class="author"><span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">L.</span><span class="author-name">林间代码</span><span class="sep"></span><time datetime="2026-10-25">2026 年 10 月 25 日</time><span class="sep"></span><span>约 8 分钟阅读</span></div></div><div class="hero-art" role="img" aria-label="Excel 表格与 Python 代码的绿色插画"><span class="art-label">LESS REPETITION. MORE CREATION.</span><div class="sheet"><div class="sheet-title"><span>▦ &nbsp; monthly_report.xlsx</span><span>− &nbsp; □ &nbsp; ×</span></div><div class="sheet-grid"><span class="cell-head"></span><span class="cell-head">A</span><span class="cell-head">B</span><span class="cell-head">C</span><span class="cell-head">D</span><span>1</span><span>PRODUCT</span><span>SALES</span><span>COST</span><span>PROFIT</span><span>2</span><span>Notebook</span><span>12,800</span><span>8,400</span><span>4,400</span><span>3</span><span>Keyboard</span><span>8,600</span><span>5,200</span><span>3,400</span><span>4</span><span class="selected">Monitor</span><span class="selected">24,600</span><span class="selected">16,200</span><span class="selected">8,400</span><span>5</span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span>6</span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div><div class="excel-badge">X</div><div class="code-card"><div class="window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span style="color:#c2ba8b">import</span> pandas <span style="color:#c2ba8b">as</span> pd<br>df = pd.read_excel(<span style="color:#bbd29e">"report.xlsx"</span>)<br>df.to_excel(<span style="color:#bbd29e">"done.xlsx"</span>, index=<span style="color:#c2ba8b">False</span>)</div><span class="art-spark">✳</span><span class="