<div class="layout"><article id="article"><div class="article-tools"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Excel</span><span class="tag">自动化办公</span><div class="tools-right"><button class="tool-button" id="save" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><use href="#bookmark"/></svg><span>收藏</span></button><button class="tool-button" id="share"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 16V3m-5 5 5-5 5 5M5 12v9h14v-9"/></svg>分享</button></div></div>
<p class="intro">每到月底，总有几张 Excel 报表等着整理：清洗数据、合并文件、统计汇总……<br>这些看似琐碎的工作，其实都可以交给 Python。本文整理了 <strong>5 个高频、实用的小技巧</strong>，让你从繁琐的表格操作中解放出来。</p>
<div class="callout"><svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><use href="#bulb"/></svg><p><strong>开始之前</strong><br>示例使用 Python 3、pandas 和 openpyxl。运行前需准备好这两个库；文章页面本身无需安装任何依赖。示例按顺序执行，源文件为 <code>sales.xlsx</code>。</p></div>
<section class="article-section" id="tip-1"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-num">01</span><h2>精准读取，只加载你需要的数据</h2></div><p>一张表有几十列，但分析可能只需要其中几列。用 <code>usecols</code> 指定字段，再为订单编号指定文本类型，保留原本存为文本的前导零。</p><div class="code-block"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-dot"></span>Python <span style="color:#617367">/</span> read_report.py<button class="copy" aria-label="复制读取数据代码"><svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><use href="#copy"/></svg><span>复制代码</span></button></div><pre><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd

<span class="comment"># 读取「销售明细」工作表，并保留订单编号的前导零</span>
df = pd.<span class="func">read_excel</span>(
    <span class="str">"sales.xlsx"</span>,
    sheet_name=<span class="str">"销售明细"</span>,
    usecols=[<span class="str">"订单编号"</span>, <span class="str">"日期"</span>, <span class="str">"地区"</span>, <span class="str">"销售额"</span>],
    dtype={<span class="str">"订单编号"</span>: <span class="str">"string"</span>},
    engine=<span class="str">"openpyxl"</span>,
)
<span class="func">print</span>(df.head())</code></pre></div><p class="inline-note"><span>↳</span>这里假设首行为表头，且每个订单一行。Excel 中仅通过数字格式显示的前导零，无法靠 dtype 恢复。</p></section>
<section class="article-section" id="tip-2"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-num">02</span><h2>一次清洗，处理空值与重复数据</h2></div><p>统一字段、修正类型，再处理缺失值和重复订单。把规则封装成函数，后续每个月都能复用。无法解析的销售额和日期先变为空值，再移除并记录数量。</p><div class="code-block"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-dot"></span>Python <span style="color:#617367">/</span> clean_data.py<button class="copy" aria-label="复制数据清洗代码"><svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><use href="#copy"/></svg><span>复制代码</span></button></div><pre><code><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="func">clean_sales</span>(data):
    data = data.copy()
    data.columns = data.columns.str.strip()
    data[<span class="str">"订单编号"</span>] = data[<span class="str">"订单编号"</span>].str.strip().replace(<span class="str">""</span>, pd.NA)
    data[<span class="str">"地区"</span>] = data[<span class="str">"地区"</span>].astype(<span class="str">"string"</span>).str.strip()
    data[<span class="str">"地区"</span>] = data[<span class="str">"地区"</span>].replace(<span class="str">""</span>, pd.NA).fillna(<span class="str">"未分类"</span>)
    data[<span class="str">"销售额"</span>] = pd.to_numeric(data[<span class="str">"销售额"</span>], errors=<span class="str">"coerce"</span>)
    data[<span class="str">"日期"</span>] = pd.to_datetime(data[<span class="str">"日期"</span>], errors=<span class="str">"coerce"</span>)
    before = <span class="func">len</span>(data)
    data = data.dropna(subset=[<span class="str">"订单编号"</span>, <span class="str">"销售额"</span>, <span class="str">"日期"</span>])
    data = data.drop_duplicates(subset=<span class="str">"订单编号"</span>, keep=<span class="str">"last"</span>)
    <span class="func">print</span>(<span class="str">f"移除了 {before - len(data)} 行无效或重复记录"</span>)
    <span class="kw">return</span> data

clean = <span class="func">clean_sales</span>(df)</code></pre></div><p class="inline-note"><span>↳</span>若一个订单包含多条商品明细，请改用“订单编号 + 商品编号”等组合键去重。</p></section>
<section class="article-section" id="tip-3"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-num">03</span><h2>批量合并，告别逐个复制粘贴</h2></div><p>把同结构的报表放进 <code>reports/</code> 文件夹，用 <code>pathlib</code> 找到它们，再用 <code>concat</code> 一次拼接。增加来源列，方便之后追溯数据。</p><div class="code-block"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-dot"></span>Python <span style="color:#617367">/</span> merge_files.py<button class="copy" aria-label="复制文件合并代码"><svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><use href="#copy"/></svg><span>复制代码</span></button></div><pre><code><span class="kw">from</span> pathlib <span class="kw">import</span> Path

files = <span class="func">sorted</span>(
    p <span class="kw">for</span> p <span class="kw">in</span> Path(<span class="str">"reports"</span>).glob(<span class="str">"*.xlsx"</span>)
    <span class="kw">if not</span> p.name.startswith(<span class="str">"~$"</span>)  <span class="comment"># 跳过 Excel 临时文件</span>
)
<span class="kw">if not</span> files:
    <span class="kw">raise</span> FileNotFoundError(<span class="str">"reports 文件夹内没有 .xlsx 报表"</span>)

frames = [
    pd.read_excel(p, sheet_name=<span class="str">"销售明细"</span>,
                  dtype={<span class="str">"订单编号"</span>: <span class="str">"string"</span>})
      .assign(来源文件=p.name)
    <span class="kw">for</span> p <span class="kw">in</span> files
]
merged = pd.<span class="func">concat</span>(frames, ignore_index=<span class="kw">True</span>)
clean = <span class="func">clean_sales</span>(merged)</code></pre></div><p class="inline-note"><span>↳</span>示例假设订单编号跨文件唯一；重复记录保留文件名排序后靠后的那一条。请先确认这符合你的业务规则。</p></section>
<section class="article-section" id="tip-4"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-num">04</span><h2>快速汇总，生成你的数据透视表</h2></div><p>想看各地区每个月的销售额？用 <code>pivot_table</code> 指定行、列、指标和汇总方式，一张清晰的月度报表就准备好了。</p><div class="code-block"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-dot"></span>Python <span style="color:#617367">/</span> summarize.py<button class="copy" aria-label="复制汇总代码"><svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><use href="#copy"/></svg><span>复制代码</span></button></div><pre><code>clean[<span class="str">"月份"</span>] = clean[<span class="str">"日期"</span>].dt.strftime(<span class="str">"%Y-%m"</span>)
summary = clean.<span class="func">pivot_table</span>(
    index=<span class="str">"地区"</span>,
    columns=<span class="str">"月份"</span>,
    values=<span class="str">"销售额"</span>,
    aggfunc=<span class="str">"sum"</span>,
    fill_value=<span class="num">0</span>,
    margins=<span class="kw">True</span>,
    margins_name=<span class="str">"总计"</span>,
)
<span class="func">print</span>(summary)</code></pre></div><p class="inline-note"><span>↳</span>输出结构示意（金额为示例数据；源数据的地区字段请勿使用“总计”）：</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>地区 / 月份</th><th>2026-08</th><th>2026-09</th><th>总计</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>华东</td><td>42,800</td><td>51,200</td><td>94,000</td></tr><tr><td>华南</td><td>36,500</td><td>40,600</td><td>77,100</td></tr><tr><td>总计</td><td>79,300</td><td>91,800</td><td>171,100</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="article-section" id="tip-5"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-num">05</span><h2>美化导出，让报表可以直接交付</h2></div><p>用 <code>ExcelWriter</code> 把明细与汇总放进同一个文件，再用 openpyxl 设置表头、列宽和金额格式。冻结首行，滚动查看数据也不容易迷失。</p><div class="code-block"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-dot"></span>Python <span style="color:#617367">/</span> export_report.py<button class="copy" aria-label="复制导出代码"><svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><use href="#copy"/></svg><span>复制代码</span></button></div><pre><code><span class="kw">from</span> openpyxl.styles <span class="kw">import</span> Font, PatternFill

<span class="comment"># 保存为新文件；再次运行会覆盖同名的输出文件</span>
<span class="kw">with</span> pd.<span class="func">ExcelWriter</span>(<span class="str">"月度销售报表.xlsx"</span>, engine=<span class="str">"openpyxl"</span>) <span class="kw">as</span> writer:
    clean.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=<span class="str">"销售明细"</span>, index=<span class="kw">False</span>)
    summary.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=<span class="str">"月度汇总"</span>)

    <span class="kw">for</span> ws <span class="kw">in</span> writer.book.worksheets:
        ws.freeze_panes = <span class="str">"B2"</span>
        ws.auto_filter.ref = ws.dimensions
        <span class="kw">for</span> cell <span class="kw">in</span> ws[<span class="num">1</span>]:
            cell.font = Font(bold=<span class="kw">True</span>, color=<span class="str">"FFFFFF"</span>)
            cell.fill = PatternFill(<span class="str">"solid"</span>, fgColor=<span class="str">"2B6B4D"</span>)
            ws.column_dimensions[cell.column_letter].width = <span class="num">20</span>
        <span class="kw">for</span> row <span class="kw">in</span> ws.iter_rows(min_row=<span class="num">2</span>):
            <span class="kw">for</span> cell <span class="kw">in</span> row:
                header = ws.cell(<span class="num">1</span>, cell.column).value
                <span class="kw">if</span> header == <span class="str">"销售额"</span> <span class="kw">or</span> (
                    ws.title == <span class="str">"月度汇总"</span> <span class="kw">and</span> cell.column &gt; <span class="num">1</span>
                ):
                    cell.number_format = <span class="str">"#,##0.00"</span></code></pre></div></section>
